        </svg>

        <div class="section-cat-flyer section-cat-flyer--left section-cat-flyer--notes" data-side="left" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="cat-float-wrap">
            <div class="cat-float-inner">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/cats/cat-5.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img class="section-cat-img" src="/cats/cat-5.svg" alt="" width="1632" height="1707" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </picture>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span> Notes</p>
            <h2 id="notes-title" class="section-title">A few things I keep noticing.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="section-body">
            <div class="note-list">
              <article class="note note--lead">
                <h3 class="note__title">Quiet software</h3>
                <p class="note__text">The best compliment a system can get is that nobody talks about it. It does the ordinary thing every day, and leaves people free to think about something else.</p>
              </article>
